# Plan: agents-arwaky — Architect

## Summary

Architecture review of the `agents-arwaky` orchestration repository covering the `tools/` directory: the unified CLI (`arwaky.py`), shared libraries (`tools/lib/`), harness connector (`connect.py`), skill manager (`skill.py`), daemon managers, backup system, MCP config generator, and install/uninstall scripts. The review evaluates layer boundary integrity, AES naming compliance, orphan detection, scalability patterns, and data-flow correctness across all Python source files in the repository. The AES 7-layer naming convention (`layer_concern_role.ext`) is applied as the primary structural standard, with acknowledgment that `tools/` is an orchestration/tooling zone rather than a core agent module, so certain rules are adapted rather than applied verbatim.

